# Accounting Fiscal Period
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Accounting — the monthly close: a period locks once every entry in it is posted
# Case 9 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: accounting-journal-entry.menata

Fiscal Period

Fields

- Period Name : Text
- Start Date : Date
- End Date : Date
- Status : Open | Closed

Events

When Close

    Every Journal Entry in this Fiscal Period must be Posted

    Status Closed

Constraints

- Period Name is required.
- Start Date is required.
- End Date is required.

    Every Journal Entry in this Fiscal Period must be Posted before Close.

Permissions

Supervisor

- Close

Views

- Period Form : Form
- Period List : List
- Period Detail : Detail
